ueprint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "85b44da4d90a2878c951c395689ceff145d7597d", "message": "Refine DFRobot C4002 mmWave presence blueprint by updating input descriptions, enhancing device selection, and improving entity resolution for target status, direction, and distance.", "created_at": "2026-03-07T17:11:12Z", "repo": "ha-blueprint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4f82715bdeda8812d64a8765355612bf00e6036d", "message": "Refine DFRobot C4002 mmWave presence blueprint by updating default values and enhancing selector options for movement direction and presence distance sensors.", "created_at": "2026-03-07T16:38:40Z", "repo": "ha-blueprint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "535744beda2e1cb145fbd56f9614ccac039e5c52", "message": "Add DFRobot C4002 mmWave presence blueprint\n\nAdd a Home Assistant automation blueprint for the DFRobot C4002 mmWave presence sensor (ESPHome). The blueprint triggers on the numeric Target Status sensor (any presence, motion, static, or cleared) and supports optional movement direction and distance filters, a configurable maximum distance (cm), and an optional trigger delay to debounce flicker. Exposes inputs for target status, direction and distance sensors, trigger type, required direction, max distance, delay, and actions. Requires Home Assistant >= 2024.6.0 and is authored by RR Commerce.", "created_at": "2026-03-07T16:35:34Z", "repo": "ha-blueprint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b06fa1cc9ad83a98626c0841472d10a6add97096", "message": "Enhance IKEA VALLHORN motion sensor blueprint by integrating VES-ZW-WAL-009 8-Button Wall Controller, refining input parameters and scene action triggers.", "created_at": "2026-01-08T19:11:13Z", "repo": "ha-blueprint", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a02fce9d027091f31327f